Here's a JSON schema for a beta cruiser:

```json
{
  "name": "beta_cruiser",
  "description": "A beta version of a cruiser.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The name of the cruiser."
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "A brief description of the cruiser."
    },
    "capacity": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 10,
      "maximum": 100,
      "description": "The maximum number of passengers the cruiser can hold."
    },
    "speed": {
      "type": "number",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 1000,
      "description": "The speed of the cruiser in km/h."
    },
    "engine_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["gasoline", "electric"],
      "description": "The type of engine used in the cruiser."
    },
    "color": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["red", "blue", "green"],
      "description": "The color of the cruiser."
    },
    "is_active": {
      type: "boolean",
      default: true,
      description: "Whether the cruiser is currently in use."
    },
    "owner": {
      type: "object",
      properties: {
        "name": {
          type: "string",
          description: "The name of the owner."
        },
        "email": {
          type: "string",
          format: "email",
          description: "The email address of the owner."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "required": ["name", "description", "capacity", "owner"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

This schema defines a basic structure for a cruiser object with the following properties:

- `name`: a string representing the name of the cruiser.
- `description`: a string describing the cruiser.
- `capacity`: an integer representing the maximum number of passengers the cruiser can hold.
- `speed`: a number representing the speed of the cruiser in km/h.
- `engine_type`: a string representing the type of engine used in the cruiser.
- `color`: a string representing the color of the cruiser.
- `is_active`: a boolean indicating whether the cruiser is currently in use.
